[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C01_ANGRY]
Cozy’s Fury

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C01_ANGRY_desc]
Cozy Glow’s outbursts of anger generate immense energy that can provide massive boosts to the empire, this is Cozy’s §OAnger Value§! Cozy’s Anger Value cannot exceed §t100%§!, or else Cozy will be in §tlife-threatening danger§!.

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C01_ANGRY]
和煦之怒

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C01_ANGRY_desc]
和煦光流愤怒时爆发出的巨大能量能为帝国提供巨量加成，这就是和煦的§O愤怒值§!，和煦的愤怒值不能超过§t100%§!，否则和煦将有§t生命危险§!。
